# iAdvize

> iAdvize builds the AI Shopping Assistant trusted by e-commerce brands to turn more shoppers into customers. It engages shoppers with sales-first AI that anticipates questions, recommends products, and guides them to checkout with confidence — used by 350+ brands generating over $1 billion in annual online revenue.

## Platform

- [Platform Overview](https://www.iadvize.com/en/platform-overview): The full iAdvize platform — AI Shopping Assistant, Shopper Insights, and Support Desk — built to launch a new storefront experience.
- [AI Shopping Assistant](https://www.iadvize.com/en/ai-shopping-assistant): iAdvize's core product. Sales-first AI (not a support chatbot) that delivers real-time guidance, personalized product recommendations, and proactive answers, driving +15% incremental revenue.
- [Shopper Insights](https://www.iadvize.com/en/shopper-insights): Performance dashboard included with the AI Shopping Assistant — tracks engagement, conversion, AOV, and AI-attributed revenue down to individual conversations.
- [Support Desk](https://www.iadvize.com/en/support-desk): Add-on ($80/agent/month) giving human agents a unified workspace, co-browsing, and AI writing assistance alongside the AI Shopping Assistant.
- [How iAdvize Is Built](https://www.iadvize.com/en/technology-stack): The technology stack behind the assistant — multi-model AI (OpenAI, Gemini), agentic reasoning, hybrid search, and AWS/Kubernetes infrastructure handling billions of monthly requests.
- [Product Tour](https://www.iadvize.com/en/product-tour): Interactive walkthrough of the AI Shopping Assistant, Shopper Insights, and Support Desk in action.

## Pricing

- [Plans & Pricing](https://www.iadvize.com/en/pricing): Essentials, Starter, and Growth plans (from $290/month), plus custom Enterprise pricing. Scales by conversation volume and catalog size (SKUs), not seats.
- [ROI Calculator](https://www.iadvize.com/en/roi-calculator): Estimates projected incremental revenue and ROI from deploying the AI Shopping Assistant, based on sessions, conversion rate, and average order value.
- [Free Trial](https://www.iadvize.com/en/free-trial): 30-day free trial on product detail pages — up to 3,000 AI-handled conversations and 10,000 SKUs, no credit card required.

